{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>Its pa'amot.</b> The corners of its lower edges." "<b>And two rings on its one side.</b> The long side is called a tselah. He therefore commanded that all four be on the four corners of the lower edges, and also commanded that they not be placed on the narrow sides, but on the long sides called tselahot — two of them on the one side and two of them on the second."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:27:09.388220441Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}